  ("p", "A volume profile rotates that ninety degrees and buckets volume by <em>price</em>: horizontal bars showing how much total volume traded at each price level over a chosen range. It answers \"which prices did the market spend its money at?\" That is the more useful question, because acceptance and rejection happen at prices, not at clock times."),
